{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "md2html-api-collection-v2-1",
    "name": "MD2HTML API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Markdown-to-HTML conversion API with JSON/text utilities, billing, and analytics.\n\n## Quick Start\n1. **Register** an API key via `GET /register` (or use IP-based billing without a key).\n2. Send the key on every billed request via the `X-API-Key` header.\n3. **Free tier**: 10 calls per client (IP or API key), then HTTP 402 + LTC payment.\n\n## Rate Limiting\n30 requests/minute per IP. Max body: 1MB (`/convert` & `/sanitize`: 50KB markdown).\n\n## Pricing\n$0.001 per call, billed in Litecoin (LTC). No subscriptions, no credit cards.\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `base_url` — API root, e.g. `http://147.15.103.217/md2html`\n- `api_key` — your `mk_...` key from `/register` (leave empty for IP-based free tier)\n\nCollection uses `{{base_url}}` and `{{api_key}}` variables throughout."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://147.15.103.217/md2html",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "MD2HTML API root URL. Default: live public instance."
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API key (mk_...) from GET /register. Empty = IP-based free tier (10 calls)."
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Assert 2xx response on all requests (skip on documented error examples).",
          "pm.test(\"response is ok\", function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201, 204]);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
